<div id="TcHmi_Controls_Beckhoff_TcHmiImage_162" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiImage" data-tchmi-height="512" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="16" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-src="Resources/Custom/Images/IO Images/el6631_transparente.png" data-tchmi-top="570" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="158" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="1">
</div>
<div id="TcHmiTextblock_752" data-tchmi-type="TcHmi.Controls.Beckhoff.TcHmiTextblock" data-tchmi-height="293" data-tchmi-height-unit="px" data-tchmi-left="245" data-tchmi-left-unit="px" data-tchmi-text="The EL6631-0010 PROFINET RT device (slave) terminal enables simple exchange of data between EtherCAT and PROFINET RT. It is a device in the EtherCAT strand, which can consist of up to 65,535 devices. The EL6631-0010 has a 3-port switch.\n\nTwo ports are fed to the outside on RJ45 sockets. This allows the I/O stations to be structured as a line topology, as a result of which the wiring is simplified. The maximum distance between two devices is 100 m.

Protocols such as LLDP or SNMP can be used for network diagnosis." data-tchmi-top="706" data-tchmi-top-unit="px" data-tchmi-width="666" data-tchmi-width-unit="px" data-tchmi-word-wrap="True" data-tchmi-text-font-size="20" data-tchmi-text-font-size-unit="px" data-tchmi-zindex="1">
</div>
